## Getting Started

### Run Locally

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/your-username/sales-analytics-dashboard.git

# Open in browser — no server or install needed
cd sales-analytics-dashboard
open index.html
```

### Deploy to GitHub Pages

1. Go to **Settings → Pages** in your repository
2. Set Source to `main` branch, `/ (root)`
3. Your dashboard will be live at:
   `https://your-username.github.io/sales-analytics-dashboard/`

